We are sitting in the living room and eating dinner.
The sound of heavy rain is coming from outside.
Asha has brought very delicious food.
Rohan and Priya also helped set the table.
I look at my friends.
I am feeling very contented today.
I came to Mumbai six months ago.
I came here only for a job.
But this time passed very quickly.
I have learned a lot in these six months.
I have made new friends.
Asha smiles and asks, "How is the food, Maya?"
Rohan says, "Asha ji and all of us prepared this together."
I say, "I liked it very much."
Priya says, "This is your first birthday in Mumbai."
I smile and thank them all.
I am very far from Mexico.
I left my home in January.
But now Mumbai has become my home.
I have truly built a life here.
